[
  {
    "file": "blocks/content-featured-product.liquid",
    "individual_findings": "Individually reviewed all 64 original controls plus four translated purchase labels and all three presets. Preserved explicit current/manual/context-fallback source precedence. Replaced unsafe global variant listeners with the existing canonical purchase controller: manually selected products have independent scope, explicit Current product shares its actual builder. Unique native forms retain selected variants even outside enumeration, native selling plans/allocations, truthful current price/compare/availability, quantity min/increment/max including hidden quantities, exact cart payload and native error fallback. Missing products hide storefront output with editor guidance. Removed duplicate editor attributes, fabricated new-preset promotional claims and sale-as-Featured badge; guarded all labels. Shared native media supports all types, initial selected media outside configured limit, dynamically needed native media, no-JS content, click-loaded embeds and disposal. Bounded nested layout/padding, no-image column, responsive/focus/editor motion repaired.",
    "settings": [
      {
